{"total_count":1,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp-stanford/issues/12","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp-stanford","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp-stanford/issues/12/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp-stanford/issues/12/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp-stanford/issues/12/events","html_url":"https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp-stanford/issues/12","id":5892449285,"node_id":"I_kwDOVGJPXs8AAAABXzekBQ","number":12,"title":"ctrl-y runs \"Delete all left\" instead of yank on Linux/Windows","user":{"login":"ericrcwu001","id":33834009,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODM0MDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33834009?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001","html_url":"https://github.com/ericrcwu001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericrcwu001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-16T23:09:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T23:09:48Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Mirrors warpdotdev/warp#11743 for the Stanford fork.\n\nOn Linux and Windows, the editable \"Delete all left\" action defaults to `ctrl-y`. The input editor\nalso has a fixed `ctrl-y` binding for yank (paste the text removed by `ctrl-u` / `ctrl-k` / `ctrl-w`).\nEditable bindings are matched first, so `ctrl-y` deletes text and yank can't be reached unless you\nclear \"Delete all left\" in Settings > Keybindings. Yank isn't listed there, so nothing tells you\nwhy.\n\nRepro (Linux):\n1. Type some text in the input.\n2. Press `ctrl-y`: text left of the cursor is deleted.\n3. Clear the \"Delete all left\" binding.\n4. Type text, press `ctrl-u`, then `ctrl-y`: the killed text is pasted back.\n\nI'd like to work on this. I'll post a proposed fix direction here before opening a PR, since the\noriginal issue leaves open whether to change the default, make yank rebindable, or warn on the conflict.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp-stanford/issues/12/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/warpdotdev/warp-stanford/issues/12/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}